Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OP
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.63,0:00:51.78,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.04,0:01:06.88,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣與你相遇
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.18,0:01:12.11,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,並不是只為了生存下去
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.29,0:01:18.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,小小的誓言超越時空
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.25,0:01:23.89,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,必定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.45,0:01:27.34,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,LIMITER　（changing myself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.34,0:01:30.51,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,釋放出來　（changing youself）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.61,0:01:36.42,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,迸發吧　天使的光芒
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.80,0:01:40.38,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,拯救世界 「翼」
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.38,0:01:43.26,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在選擇的道路
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.43,0:01:49.65,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,想要抓住夢幻（停不下來）
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.73,0:01:52.55,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,被賦予的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.55,0:01:55.18,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,向著天空迫近
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.18,0:02:00.97,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,強力凜然振翅高飛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.25,0:02:06.83,OP,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐　my wings
Comment: 0,0:00:00.55,0:00:00.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,ED
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:26.22,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,緊緊地抱住逞強的你
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.22,0:22:29.15,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,就連難過的側臉　全部
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.15,0:22:31.52,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,讓·人·心·愛
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.52,0:22:35.73,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,每打破障壁都會變強的女人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.73,0:22:41.64,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,我的眼·睛　沒有不正常
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.90,0:22:46.91,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,過於率直的心中的情感
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.91,0:22:50.44,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,是不會輸給任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.44,0:22:55.71,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對不會放開你　不管在什麼時候
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.71,0:23:00.92,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,這看不到結局的一切　由我來改變
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.92,0:23:05.26,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,惡魔和天使都有翅膀
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.26,0:23:10.90,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,指引著前往更高的天空
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.90,0:23:15.60,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,不會再讓你的笑容變得陰沉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.60,0:23:22.00,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,連結的希望　現在撕裂了黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.00,0:23:24.94,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,和你一起
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.18,0:23:30.89,ED,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,500)}向著明天飛躍　Break Your Destiny
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Default,,0,0,0,,TEXT
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.45,0:00:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎光臨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.55,0:00:04.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,歡迎來到B.A.B.E.L.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好孩子們
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.10,0:00:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感謝你們一直在收看「絕對可憐Children」
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.03,0:00:13.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天想讓大家更多地了解我們Double Face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,欸  擅自決定了？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.40,0:00:15.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腳本上沒有這段啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.28,0:00:16.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒事沒事
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.60,0:00:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做事還是這麼狡猾啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.89,0:00:18.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.97,0:00:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先  短髮端莊嫻淑的就是我  野分螢
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:26.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然說自己端莊嫻淑…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.76,0:00:32.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而長髮有著可愛吊眼的就是我  常盤奈津子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.45,0:00:33.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可愛的吊眼啊…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.67,0:00:34.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.53,0:00:37.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們Double Face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:39.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就請多關照了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.97,0:00:43.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以上內容由野分螢和常盤奈津子帶來
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.16,0:02:20.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,六十多年前
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.05,0:02:24.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,軍隊創造的預知能力者做出了某個預知
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.61,0:02:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總有一天超能力者和普通人的對立  將發展成世界規模的爭鬥
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.09,0:02:33.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,領導戰爭的是兵部少佐
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.90,0:02:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是不久之後將出現把這場戰爭引向勝利
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.66,0:02:41.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,解放包括P.A.N.D.R.A.在內的一切超能力者的救世主
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.62,0:02:48.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.72,0:02:49.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很正點嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:51.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身材纖細兼巨乳
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.29,0:02:52.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  貧乳那個要更…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.72,0:02:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而女王們現在的樣子就是這個
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.05,0:02:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這幫傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.45,0:03:00.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一群自大傲慢的小鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.12,0:03:01.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是因為這幫傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.98,0:03:03.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我才無法在B.A.B.E.L.待下去的
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.80,0:03:05.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吧  小萌香
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是小萌香  她們根本就是罪犯
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.28,0:03:07.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個樣子更好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.48,0:03:09.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  這裡有罪犯預備軍
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:14.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗬  所以少佐才會執著於這幫傢伙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.38,0:03:15.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過不覺得奇怪嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.43,0:03:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果那預知是100%的話
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.62,0:03:21.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼在那個時刻到來之前順其自然不就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.91,0:03:23.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼要進行干涉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.01,0:03:26.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他該不會是想要改變未來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.47,0:03:28.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼他想改變成怎樣的未來？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.87,0:03:29.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不清楚
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.94,0:03:33.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他應該有什麼深刻的想法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.18,0:03:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者是…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.42,0:03:37.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,或者是？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.48,0:03:40.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其實他什麼都沒想
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(730,570)\fad(500,500)}34th  sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.18,0:03:44.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs32\pos(820,600)\fad(500,500)}「朝蠅暮蚊！皆本用手還是用腳？！」
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.74,0:03:49.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,預知系統預知到有事故要發生
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.80,0:03:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大規模的生物災害  會引發生物汙染
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.70,0:03:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,局長
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.40,0:03:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特殊超能力者  出動
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.44,0:03:58.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,生物汙染？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.16,0:04:00.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說什麼生物災害…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.91,0:04:03.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但這裡根本沒有危險的細菌或動物
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.42,0:04:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最多是大老鼠或蒼蠅之類的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.74,0:04:11.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本局的預知系統告知有70%的機率會發生
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.34,0:04:13.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們派最優秀的隊伍過去了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.45,0:04:15.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請給予他們協助
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.32,0:04:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  不管怎麼說這也太小題大作了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.97,0:04:32.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是B.A.B.E.L.的皆本二尉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.94,0:04:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不用擔心
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.78,0:04:36.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們一定會改變未來的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.45,0:04:37.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是說…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.02,0:04:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,防護服好了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.17,0:04:38.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.22,0:04:41.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,開始執行任務  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.55,0:04:42.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,了解
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.37,0:04:44.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,The Children  解禁
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.49,0:04:45.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.32,0:04:49.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小孩子是風之子  活力之子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.20,0:04:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,才不會輸給病毒的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.13,0:04:53.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要忘記洗手和漱口
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.16,0:04:56.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們上吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.73,0:04:57.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.18,0:05:00.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口罩  袖子還有長褲哪去了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.88,0:05:02.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這個樣子比較可愛嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.41,0:05:04.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠可愛能贏病毒嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.74,0:05:06.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,話雖如此  但什麼事都還沒發生啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.15,0:05:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在沒有奇怪的細菌和病毒啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.69,0:05:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是  可是…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:11.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒關係的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.89,0:05:13.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要可愛才能發揮力量啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.20,0:05:17.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,混帳東西  The Children可是國寶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.67,0:05:19.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如有萬一那該怎麼辦啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.81,0:05:21.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,正是如此  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:22.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谷崎主任
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.89,0:05:24.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,應該讓她們穿上防護服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.31,0:05:26.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使孩子們不願意
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.20,0:05:30.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也絕對要讓她們穿上防護服  以免發生萬一的事態
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.10,0:05:34.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這才是主任的義務吧  皆本君
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.70,0:05:38.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像我就讓直美穿好防護服了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:41.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Come On！Wild Cat直美
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.71,0:05:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是為了直美而開發的特製透明防護服
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.27,0:05:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀～  這件衣服好性感
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.08,0:05:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你以為我會這樣說嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  這股疼痛
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.46,0:05:55.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我現在確實還存在於這個世界啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:05:58.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,腦子被生物汙染了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.33,0:05:59.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來是的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.54,0:06:00.42,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs42}給我去死
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.41,0:06:03.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.24,0:06:04.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,發生什麼事了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.20,0:06:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.07,0:06:04.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.71,0:06:08.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.94,0:06:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,突…突然感到一陣惡寒…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.59,0:06:12.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我突然也…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.12,0:06:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀  我們穿成這樣…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:19.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你為什麼不極力阻止我們啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.61,0:06:20.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原來是這麼一回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.64,0:06:23.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,離預知的時間還有數分鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.23,0:06:25.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這並不是汙染所引起的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.53,0:06:28.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼會是什麼…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.99,0:06:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,仔細想想  時間已經…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.58,0:06:35.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你那邊怎麼樣  谷崎主任
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.12,0:06:39.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們這邊也一樣  研究員全體暈倒了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.12,0:06:41.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,咦  腫塊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.98,0:06:43.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  腫塊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.90,0:06:44.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  這邊也有
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.00,0:06:51.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這  這是？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.80,0:06:59.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  難道？！
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:00.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要動  薰
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:11.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你幹什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.17,0:07:13.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎麼了  出什麼事了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.57,0:07:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.46,0:07:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我咬緊牙關
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.37,0:07:20.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,討厭我了？  你開始討厭我了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.96,0:07:22.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為我會用超能力欺負你？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.52,0:07:24.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就因為這種事而對小孩子動手嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:25.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.52,0:07:29.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這些人是因為互相衝撞才昏倒的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.51,0:07:33.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家都想拍打停在自己身上的蒼蠅
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.98,0:07:36.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.90,0:07:47.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫…紫穗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.44,0:07:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人類們
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.90,0:07:52.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的時代已經結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下來將是我們蒼蠅的時代
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗被憑依了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被蒼蠅控制了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.51,0:08:04.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過那是紫穗的真心話吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.86,0:08:07.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果是真心話那為什麼要說什麼蒼蠅的時代啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.73,0:08:03.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們人類對於地球來說是危害
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.71,0:08:07.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從質量和數量上來看我們才最適合成為地上的支配者
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.75,0:08:11.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此在今天我們要對人類宣戰
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.51,0:08:15.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要讓驕傲自滿的靈長類認識到我們的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.03,0:08:08.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.13,0:08:10.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然有這樣的想法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.93,0:08:13.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都說了不是啊  原因是那隻蒼蠅
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:16.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,必須讓紫穗脫離它的支配
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.97,0:08:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情況我基本了解了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.33,0:08:27.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已經沒你的事了  痛苦地死去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.63,0:08:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是用感應能力故意讓它連上來的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.51,0:08:34.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我要棋高一招
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:35.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.79,0:08:37.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可…可怕的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.20,0:08:45.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也就是說在這個設施中\N進行著使用蒼蠅神經迴路的研究是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.68,0:08:46.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.87,0:08:51.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而碰巧研究員中有潛在性的感應能力者嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.27,0:08:54.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在往蒼蠅的神經輸送電流信號的時候
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.03,0:08:57.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像偶然和他的意識同步了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.36,0:09:01.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而那個人的腦中有蒼蠅的外部記憶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.13,0:09:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,誕生了具有人的思考力和蒼蠅的意志\N並且是具備感應能力的蒼蠅人
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.79,0:09:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是很遺憾  我搞不清楚他現在在哪裡
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:14.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人格的汙染…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:16.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這就是這次預知的真相嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.08,0:09:18.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.40,0:09:21.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼為什麼職員們會變成那個樣子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.62,0:09:26.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在變成蒼蠅人之前的能力是非常低的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.43,0:09:28.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,對人應該沒什麼影響
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.74,0:09:30.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是更加…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.59,0:09:32.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是因為已經結合了一次
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.92,0:09:35.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以他和蒼蠅的相容性變得非常好
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.13,0:09:38.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因此現在不管是哪隻蒼蠅他都能夠控…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.01,0:09:42.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.13,0:09:48.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,通過蒼蠅與人接觸  可以使得汙染擴大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.21,0:09:49.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就像那個樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.78,0:09:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在治療好蒼蠅人之前我們是無能為力的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.37,0:09:54.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們也真遺憾…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:56.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  真危險啊
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:10:00.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為是超能力者  所以多少有些抗性的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.43,0:10:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過如果皆本先生沒有發覺到的話
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.29,0:10:02.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就有趣…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.09,0:10:05.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  那就不得了了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.29,0:10:07.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你到底是敵是友啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.05,0:10:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先將這裡封鎖吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:13.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將殺蟲劑送過來把蒼蠅全部處理…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:17.73,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(260,300)}生物災害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:17.73,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(470,385)}生物學的有害物質：在生物學研究中
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:17.73,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(415,470)}使用、製造出來的病原物質。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:17.73,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,{\pos(400,555)}以及因其引發的生物學災害
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.73,0:10:19.83,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,這是要解決襲擊某個研究所的大規模生物災害的\N特殊超能力者小隊[The Chlidren]的三名少女的故事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.41,0:10:19.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}キュンキュン{\r}\N砰砰
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.91,0:10:20.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}モエモエ{\r}\N萌萌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:21.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}ハエハエ{\r}\N蒼蠅蒼蠅
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.45,0:10:27.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}えっ　いやぁ　別に{\r}\N欸  不  沒什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.88,0:10:36.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,愚蠢的人類
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.72,0:10:38.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,從今以後將是蒼蠅的時代
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.16,0:10:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.56,0:10:43.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Psychic Tornado{\r}\N念…念動龍捲
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.00,0:10:47.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,葵  離開這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.38,0:10:48.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不能到外面去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.48,0:10:50.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有已經將卵產在他身上的可能性的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:55.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總…總之先…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.11,0:11:00.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  男…男廁所
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.48,0:11:01.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,現在是不好意思的時候嗎！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.67,0:11:04.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不  這對於大和撫子來說是正確的反應
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.61,0:11:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣就可以了  直美
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.36,0:11:07.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把門的縫隙堵住
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.61,0:11:11.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.89,0:11:18.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行  這麼做的話你的人生就結束了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.65,0:11:20.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家來阻止他
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.14,0:11:21.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本君居然有這樣的興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.70,0:11:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要說什麼興趣！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.05,0:11:26.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在笑什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:27.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也過來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.08,0:11:28.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.64,0:11:30.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部京介？！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生  桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.95,0:11:36.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們來做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.27,0:11:39.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒什麼  我只是來玩玩而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.30,0:11:42.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,參觀一下你們工作的樣子
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.73,0:11:45.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是沒想到…  沒想到能看到這麼有趣的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.56,0:11:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.66,0:11:48.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:50.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,回想起作為天才精英的尊嚴！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:56.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要光在那裡笑  想想辦法啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不做  我又沒這個義務幫他
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:02.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們還是拋棄這種傢伙到我們這來吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:03.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.35,0:12:05.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,去你妹的生態環境  讓我舔啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.07,0:12:09.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將蒼蠅人治療好的話  我想應該就能消除影響的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.48,0:12:11.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過可沒確證
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.53,0:12:13.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,說不定會一輩子這個樣子哦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.51,0:12:18.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們只是我們的糧食生產裝置罷了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.79,0:12:20.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一輩子這個樣子？！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.28,0:12:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如…如果萬一出現這種情況的話
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.24,0:12:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會照顧他一輩子的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.23,0:12:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看啊  皆本  夕陽很美吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.57,0:12:46.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我想吃大便
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.46,0:12:47.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.78,0:12:49.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,天氣真不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.85,0:12:51.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下週是皆本你的生日吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.08,0:12:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有什麼想吃的東西嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.10,0:12:55.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想吃大便
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.55,0:12:58.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,漢堡和炸蝦啊  我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.41,0:13:02.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你知道嗎  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.56,0:13:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,似乎要發生超能力者和普通人的戰爭了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.67,0:13:07.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想吃大便
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.20,0:13:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.74,0:13:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情和我們沒有關係
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.28,0:13:13.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想吃大便
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.77,0:13:16.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯  夕陽很美啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.84,0:13:21.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這可麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.24,0:13:25.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,呀～！！  我不想看到張嘴就說大便的皆本先生
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.83,0:13:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要殺死皆本先生  然後再自殺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.64,0:13:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這…這也不好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.84,0:13:33.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,行了  快來幫忙吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.88,0:13:36.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你應該希望剩餘的人生還是個男人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.81,0:13:38.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這是最要不得的…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.14,0:13:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,OK  我明白了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.78,0:13:43.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是好運的男人啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:45.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不過我只是給你們一個建議
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.01,0:13:51.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:55.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是蒼蠅男的本體
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.08,0:14:00.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只剩下你們了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.32,0:14:03.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我…我不會讓你碰直美一根手指的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.13,0:14:06.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢著！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.14,0:14:08.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這點事算什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.78,0:14:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.20,0:14:15.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不要再碰我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.88,0:14:18.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,髒東西  髒東西！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.54,0:14:20.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.57,0:14:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  振作點啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.27,0:14:22.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,桃太郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.47,0:14:24.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包在我身上
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.00,0:14:30.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生  不行的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.18,0:14:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那裡不行  那裡也不行
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.46,0:14:38.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  爽了一身汗
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.57,0:14:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  到頭來  只憑你一個人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.13,0:14:44.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,連這麼個小預知都無法改變
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.02,0:14:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,給我有點自知之明吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:50.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,越是期待就越沒意義嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.22,0:14:54.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到你了  蒼蠅男
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:56.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,待在那裡別動
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.01,0:15:08.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼逃到這邊來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:10.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要過來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.86,0:15:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小薰  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.83,0:15:14.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抑制住力量
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.23,0:15:16.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,玻璃破掉的話  它們就會跑到外面去的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.49,0:15:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抑制過頭了  抑制過頭了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.27,0:15:23.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可惡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:24.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要破了  要破了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.63,0:15:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太強了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.86,0:15:27.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太…太難了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.01,0:15:30.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比用筷子夾湯豆腐還難啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:34.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被包圍了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.12,0:15:35.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,瞬移呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.04,0:15:37.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空間噪音太多了  不行
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.15,0:15:39.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你們知道嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.51,0:15:44.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,據說蒼蠅男的恐怖之處在於\N瞬移失敗的話就會變成和蒼蠅合體的人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.29,0:15:49.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂  怎麼樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.27,0:15:50.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生？！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.46,0:15:52.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了吧  蒼蠅男
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.08,0:15:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓他昏過去的話  蒼蠅就會失去智力
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.62,0:15:59.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之後再將蒼蠅驅除  我想就應該能夠治療了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.40,0:16:00.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,兵部先生  幫幫我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.59,0:16:01.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蒼蠅太多了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.40,0:16:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量的控制…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.07,0:16:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊  讓人火大
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.90,0:16:07.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麼就用風吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.01,0:16:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,風？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.10,0:16:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是直接而是間接增強力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.39,0:16:14.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你試試驅動空氣來製造風
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.66,0:16:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.80,0:16:18.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fs28}Psychic God Bless{\r}\N念動神風之術
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.62,0:16:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好  這樣應該可以的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.61,0:16:35.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再稍微服務下觀眾
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.20,0:16:37.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你分什麼神啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.87,0:16:40.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你自己不也是同樣的服裝嗎  有什麼好玩的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.81,0:16:42.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們居然敢把我的同伴給…！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.21,0:16:47.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.94,0:16:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.35,0:16:53.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,薰  暫時撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.45,0:17:02.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們竟敢肆意殺戮
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:04.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我們也是活著的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.23,0:17:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們人類的智力和感情不過是如此而已
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:13.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,將對方定義為小蟲  就可以毫不痛心地進行殘殺
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.00,0:17:16.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因為你們是蟲子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:20.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是會在碰了大便之後又停在飯菜上的害蟲啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.62,0:17:24.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要讓你們體會作為蟲子而被殺害的痛苦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.82,0:17:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為蟲子而被殺害的痛苦？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.45,0:17:33.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,這種事情我早已體會過了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.55,0:17:36.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,事到如今根本沒有讓你來教我的必要
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:38.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你比我想像中的能幹嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.53,0:17:40.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒想到反射神經也變得和蒼蠅一樣了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.30,0:17:45.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看來這活對於小姑娘們來說有些太沉重了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.83,0:17:59.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎麼做好呢
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:01.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,槍估計是打不中的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.04,0:18:05.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算要用超能力  但是在這麼大群的蒼蠅之中
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.50,0:18:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不能在一瞬間將它們全部消滅
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.61,0:18:09.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就會給予他緩衝的時間
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:12.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算了  沒辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.47,0:18:15.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為了女王們  也只好頂著風險做了…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.17,0:18:21.48,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,使用火災警報器！  皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.30,0:18:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.22,0:18:31.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好  會淹死的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.84,0:18:33.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,住手
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.25,0:18:36.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那傢伙  憑藉僅存的意志
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.23,0:18:38.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干涉了蒼蠅的動向嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.25,0:18:40.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.09,0:18:42.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,念動…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.91,0:18:47.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像這樣把蒼蠅抓住的那個東西
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.21,0:18:50.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那…那是捕蠅草
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.71,0:18:53.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,逮捕蒼蠅男  完成
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.68,0:19:01.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,洗滌劑含有降低液體表面張力的藥品
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.67,0:19:04.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是消滅昆蟲的特效藥哦
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.68,0:19:08.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我小時候經常這樣玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.14,0:19:10.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,紫…紫穗
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.33,0:19:11.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可怕的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.83,0:19:14.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,總之算是解決了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.29,0:19:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,Thank You  多虧你…  咦？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.73,0:19:25.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們的任務應該是防止生物災害發生吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.94,0:19:28.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是這次也沒能夠防止
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.66,0:19:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你明白嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.80,0:19:33.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是因為有了預知系統而得以迅速應對而已
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.78,0:19:38.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也發生過你們到達現場是包含在預知之中的情況吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.99,0:19:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就連B.A.B.E.L.的日常預知出動也干成這副德行
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.37,0:19:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那更為巨大的世界規模的趨勢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,憑你是不可能改變的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.56,0:19:50.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所指向的未來只有一個
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.06,0:19:55.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身為普通人的你  根本沒有改變大勢的能力
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.04,0:19:59.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讓我告訴你變得輕鬆的方法吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.62,0:20:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,隨波逐流吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.59,0:20:03.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我會協助你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.57,0:20:08.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要全力對你施加催眠暗示
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.55,0:20:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那個預知  超能力者和普通人的戰爭給忘掉
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.95,0:20:18.70,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,我拒絕！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.38,0:20:19.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什麼？！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.01,0:20:22.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,即使憑我一個人辦不到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.24,0:20:25.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是集契約伴們的力量就能夠做到
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.09,0:20:27.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,B.A.B.E.L.就是為此而存在的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.28,0:20:31.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,人類的力量是比你所認為的要強多了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.14,0:20:37.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更何況我的大多數同伴是和你一樣的超能力者
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.42,0:20:48.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.24,0:20:54.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,結束了  某些東西結束了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,GoodBye  我的少女時代
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.50,0:20:57.75,zhushi,NTP,0,0,0,,別說了  快救我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.13,0:21:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哼  盡說大話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.12,0:21:03.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,普通人勢力也會聚集力量來戰鬥的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.92,0:21:05.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快點對皆本先生進行消毒
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.12,0:21:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算掉在地板上  在三秒規則內還是沒問題的！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:08.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,皆本先生…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.01,0:21:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超能力者和普通人的戰爭是不可避免的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.14,0:21:12.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也沒什麼關係
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.73,0:21:14.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.74,0:21:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只是對讓那些孩子傷心而感到心痛而已
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.61,0:21:27.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你在做什麼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.41,0:21:29.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找你好久了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.22,0:21:33.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,作為犯罪組織的老大  給我認真點工作啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.29,0:21:33.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你這傢伙
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.05,0:21:35.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老是四處亂逛  和小鬼們玩耍的話
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.58,0:21:36.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小心我殺了你  老鬼
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.23,0:21:39.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真木兄是這樣說的
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.69,0:21:40.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,少騙人了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.01,0:21:42.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明顯是你說的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.81,0:21:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你說誰是老鬼啊  你這小鬼頭
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.01,0:21:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了  快回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.40,0:21:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的力量只為超能力者而用
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.95,0:21:51.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直到這個傷痕消失為止
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.66,0:22:03.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你們在這裡做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.81,0:22:05.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,沒  只是有點…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.40,0:22:07.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,擔心後遺症…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.41,0:22:09.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要再在這件事上糾結了！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.65,0:23:43.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下回的絕對可憐Children是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.67,0:23:45.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音不想在Hound裡做了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.69,0:23:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,為什麼就這麼不喜歡我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.75,0:23:48.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我討厭你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.94,0:23:50.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要阻止你的一切
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.08,0:23:53.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇  真過分
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.27,0:23:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐Children
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.69,0:23:58.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第35話  「多情多恨！初音離家出走」
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.32,0:24:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小鹿主任  你很出色
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.52,0:24:01.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,請不要辭職
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.67,0:24:03.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不管怎麼看  原因都是出在這裡
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.95,0:24:05.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初音太可憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.36,0:24:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.25,0:24:08.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,絕對可憐  所以不會輸！

